## 🛠️ Tech Stack

<!-- Edit to match what you actually use -->

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Frontend | React / Next.js, Tailwind CSS |
| Path graph | React Flow (or D3.js) |
| Calendar | FullCalendar |
| Backend | Node.js + Express (or your choice) |
| Database | PostgreSQL / MongoDB |
| Auth | JWT / OAuth |
| Hosting | Vercel / Render / Docker |

