## 📁 Project Structure

```
skillpath/
├── src/
│   ├── components/      # Reusable UI components
│   ├── pages/           # App pages (Path, Calendar, Library)
│   ├── data/            # Skill definitions & prerequisites
│   ├── hooks/           # Custom React hooks
│   ├── services/        # API calls
│   └── styles/          # Global styles
├── server/              # Backend API
├── public/              # Static assets
├── .env.example
├── package.json
└── README.md
```

---

## 🧩 Adding a New Skill

Skills are defined in `src/data/skills.json`:

```json
{
  "id": "python-basics",
  "name": "Python Basics",
  "category": "language",
  "level": "beginner",
  "estimatedHours": 20,
  "prerequisites": [],
  "resources": [
    { "title": "Official Python Tutorial", "url": "https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/" }
  ]
}
```

